        "original_id": "8aafd5d9-0a67-5bb2-a2e1-a875da1f9ec3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Ainslee's Magazine, The Australian Women's Weekly, Strand Magazine\n- Works: The Prince and Betty\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- Places: United States, United Kingdom, Sydney\n\nFacts:\n- Ainslee's Magazine was an American literary periodical published from 1897 to December 1926.\n- The Prince and Betty was originally published in Ainslee's Magazine in the United States in January 1912.\n- The Prince and Betty was published in a slightly different form as a serial in Strand Magazine in the United Kingdom between February and April 1912.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly, also known as The Weekly, is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.",
